---LINES

mainv   = mx - - - - " main view                         "
mainvk  = c   "main view keys:"

cmded   = mx - - - - " command editor                  "
cmdedk  = c   "command editor keys:"

exit    = ax - - - - " exit trap                "
exitk   = c   "keys of trap on exit:"

hist    = ax - - - - " history view             "
histk   = c   "history view keys:"

runcmd  = hm "run a command"

---# m       = gm  - - - - " *)"
m       = g  - - - - " *)"
---# a       = cx "<1>"
---# b       = cx "<2>"
---# c       = cx "<3>"
a       = cx "*1"
b       = cx "*2"
c       = cx "*3"

X	= hx "="
cmd     = hx "[a-z./]"
CMD     = hx "[A-Z0-9]"

---SCREEN
=vash workflow -- context switching                                      
+                                      please, see 'man vash' for more details       
+.mainvk...............................                                       
+ .:CA switch between editor and main                                         
+ .'uppercase                               .:HE... - help            
+     execute predefined command   .a       .:EX... - exit,return           
+     edit a command from template .b       .:CA    - cancel                
+ .'lowercase                                
+     type a command from scratch  .c       .mainv............................. 
+                                           .CMD.... .cmd...     ^     .:CA  ^  
+.cmdedk...............................      :   :   :         .X:       :   :  
+ .:HE... switch to history view           .a:   :   : .hist..........   :   :  
+ .:NL... run a command, sync history        : .b:   :     ^   .:NL...   :   :  
+                                            :   : .c:     :     :       :   :  
+.histk................................      :   :   : .:HE...   :     .:CA  :  
+ .:CA    return to editor untouched         : .cmded......................  :  
+ .:NL... take a command to editor           :   .:NL...          ^          :  
+                                            :     :            .c:          :  
+.exitk................................      :     :              :        .:CA      
+ .:SP...| .:CA return to main view          :     :            .cmd...  .:SP...       
+ .'lovercase  return to editor             .runcmd........-> .exit............     
                                                                                
---END                                                                         
+  .:NL...  - defencive trap for mistakes   
+                                     .m. see 'man vash' for details
